Genesis

The Rust engine under crates/ is a derivative work of two projects released
by Sakana AI under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Both were rewritten in
Rust and combined into one engine; docs/rust_engine.md lists what changed.

  ShinkaEvolve  https://github.com/SakanaAI/ShinkaEvolve
  Copyright 2025 Sakana AI
    The island archive, parent and inspiration sampling, the SEARCH/REPLACE
    and full-rewrite patch formats with EVOLVE-BLOCK regions, the bandits
    for model selection, novelty rejection, the meta scratchpad, prompt
    co-evolution, the run-database schema, the bundled model price table,
    and the prompt templates in crates/genesis-evolve/src/prompts/templates.rs.

  The Agentic Scientist (AI-Scientist-v3)  https://github.com/SakanaAI/AI-Scientist-v3
  Copyright 2026 Sakana AI
    Ideas with target rubrics, harness-evaluated coding-agent attempts,
    campaign memory with distilled conclusions, the run envelope and its
    phases (task drafting, investigation, ablations, sealed final
    evaluation, post-hoc analysis, paper with an evidence audit, review,
    revision), and the prompts those phases adapt.

The Python package under genesis/ is a fork of ShinkaEvolve.

